{%- comment -%}
  Plaayers Club: who is looking. Prints "tier|credit_fils|spend_fils" for the caller to split.
    tier   guest | plaayer | pro | legend
    credit Plaay credit balance in fils (customer metafield plaay_club.credit, kept by the app
           alongside Shopify store credit)
    spend  spend in the last 12 months in fils (plaay_club.spend_12m, worked out nightly)
  The tier comes from plaay_club.tier (set nightly by the delivery app). On a preview theme,
  "Preview as" in Theme settings > Plaayers Club shows any tier with example numbers.
  Usage: {%- capture cs -%}{%- render 'club-state' -%}{%- endcapture -%}{%- assign cs = cs | split: '|' -%}
{%- endcomment -%}
{%- liquid
  assign tier = 'guest'
  assign credit = 0
  assign spend = 0
  if settings.club_preview_as != blank and settings.club_preview_as != 'off'
    assign tier = settings.club_preview_as
    if tier != 'guest'
      assign credit = settings.club_preview_credit | times: 100
      assign spend = settings.club_preview_spend | times: 100
    endif
  elsif customer
    assign tier = customer.metafields.plaay_club.tier.value | default: 'plaayer'
    assign credit = customer.metafields.plaay_club.credit.value | default: 0 | plus: 0
    assign spend = customer.metafields.plaay_club.spend_12m.value | default: 0 | plus: 0
  endif
  echo tier | append: '|' | append: credit | append: '|' | append: spend
-%}
